                                "sense_id": "64db9eda-af3a-343b-88b0-873ade006697",
                                "text": "Some would argue that a moped is little more than a motorized bicycle, but others would disagree."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "01a5f410-c490-362d-b871-d0e0708e08be",
                        "entry_id": "aad81ef1-740b-3df4-a305-8c53ed45d1b6",
