                                "sense_id": "01a5f410-c490-362d-b871-d0e0708e08be",
                                "text": "Because the medic had been supplied with a jeep, he and his aide were classed as a motorized detachment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef7f083b-949b-41e1-9be2-bfcc6f1f3939",
                                "sense_id": "01a5f410-c490-362d-b871-d0e0708e08be",
                                "text": "In Britain's highly motorized towns, increasing congestion and noxious emissions, as well as concerns about the nation's health, highlight a need to adopt more sustainable forms of transport like cycling and walking."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
